we just talked about,

238
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:32,800
in addition to the risk
factors that are associated

239
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:37,260
with IE. And the major
criteria have to do

240
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:40,940
