260
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,900
by clotting systemic
clotting of the blood so

261
00:15:56,750 --> 00:16:00,730
the workup for a patient
would start with a history

262
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:04,870
and physical and if there's
