and confirm a valvular

280
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:17,170
vegetation and help with
the diagnosis. Now, if you

281
00:17:17,170 --> 00:17:24,210
can confirm a case of IE,
oftentimes you would then

282
00:17:24,210 --> 00:17:27,370
