287
00:17:48,390 --> 00:17:51,490
All right, so before
we finish up our talk

288
00:17:51,490 --> 00:17:53,390
on endocarditis, I
just wanted to touch

289
00:17:53,390 --> 00:17:56,850
on morantic endocarditis,
which is the non

290
00:17:56,850 --> 00:17:59,830
-bacterial thrombotic
form of endocarditis.

291
00:18:00,730 --> 00:18:04,870
So in this situation, it
basically mirrors what

292
00:18:04,870 --> 00:18:08,670
