injury, and then the

294
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:15,030
accumulation of serum
proteins and platelets at

295
00:18:15,030 --> 00:18:18,830
that location, producing a
vegetation or a thrombus.

296
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:22,290
But in this case, the thrombus
