297
00:18:22,290 --> 00:18:25,030
There's no microbial
population associated with it.

298
00:18:25,230 --> 00:18:28,930
Now, individuals that might
have this generally are

299
00:18:28,930 --> 00:18:32,210
going to have some sort
of hypercoagulable state.

300
00:18:32,210 --> 00:18:35,550
So it's associated with
different varieties of

301
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:38,390
advanced malignancies like
certain types of cancers

302
00:18:38,390 --> 00:18:42,670
