situation like pregnancy.

307
00:18:57,250 --> 00:19:01,390
Now, individuals that have
morantic endocarditis,

308
00:19:01,410 --> 00:19:04,810
they can be asymptomatic,
but ultimately the

309
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:08,270
complications can be the same
