311
00:19:12,530 --> 00:19:15,170
parts of it break off
and become septic emboli,

312
00:19:15,170 --> 00:19:18,530
just like you would see
in infective endocarditis.

313
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:26,070
All right, so we're going
to move on to myocarditis

314
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:28,970
here, which is an inflammation
of the heart muscle,

315
00:19:28,970 --> 00:19:33,490
the myocardium, along with
myocyte necrosis. Now,

316
00:19:33,490 --> 00:19:35,890
this was also recently
relevant during the COVID

317
00:19:35,890 --> 00:19:41,510
-19 pandemic, where a very
small number of COVID-19

318
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:46,450
vaccine recipients showed
mild forms and mild symptoms

319
00:19:46,450 --> 00:19:50,070
of myocarditis. Now,
it's not fully understood

320
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:53,230
why that was the case,
but the transient symptoms

321
00:19:53,230 --> 00:19:56,230
were likely just brought
about by individual pro

322
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:59,190
-inflammatory signaling causing
the heart inflammation.

323
00:20:03,570 --> 00:20:06,350
Now, there's a number
of different reasons why

324
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:10,290
myocarditis can arise, but
the first thing to mention

325
00:20:10,290 --> 00:20:14,150
here is that approximately
50% of all cases are

326
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:18,750
idiopathic with the causative
agent going unidentified.

327
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:22,710
Now, of course, there are
some definitive causes for

328
00:20:23,090 --> 00:20:27,510
myocarditis infection would
be one and that could be a

329
00:20:27,510 --> 00:20:32,870
whole host of different
infective agents toxins as well

330
00:20:32,870 --> 00:20:37,990
