337
00:20:58,370 --> 00:21:01,170
So allergic responses,
things like hypersensitivity

338
00:21:01,170 --> 00:21:04,290
reactions to something
like penicillin, or you

339
00:21:04,290 --> 00:21:09,010
could consider more systemic
disorders like lupus or

340
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:12,150
celiac disease, Crohn disease,
things of that nature.

341
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:14,950
And, of course,
physical agents as

342
00:21:14,950 --> 00:21:16,840
well can bring
about myocarditis,

343
00:21:18,690 --> 00:21:21,690
so pretty severe
electric shock,

344
00:21:21,690 --> 00:21:25,110
radiation treatment
for certain cancers,

345
00:21:25,210 --> 00:21:28,650
or even just simple blunt
force trauma to the chest.

346
00:21:32,120 --> 00:21:34,510
All right, so we're going
to take a look at some of

347
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:40,670
the main microbial causes
of myocarditis, and the main

348
00:21:40,670 --> 00:21:43,230
cause is really going to
be dictated by location.

349
00:21:43,530 --> 00:21:49,690
So in North America and
Europe, the main cause is

350
00:21:49,690 --> 00:21:52,310
generally going to be
viral, so a whole host of

351
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:56,150
different viruses that can
cause the inflammation.

352
00:21:56,150 --> 00:21:59,910
Some of the main ones are
