00:24:00,710 --> 00:24:04,230
right now myocarditis is going
to be much less frequently

386
00:24:04,230 --> 00:24:07,450
caused by bacterial
infections but there is one

387
00:24:07,450 --> 00:24:10,590
correlation to make here
with Lyme disease which is

388
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:13,770
caused by a bacterial
infection and is also something

389
00:24:13,790 --> 00:24:17,730
