422
00:26:12,330 --> 00:26:14,250
utilizing antibiotics early

423
00:26:14,250 --> 00:26:16,930
on in the course of infection

424
00:26:20,670 --> 00:26:24,850
so the clinical manifestation
of myocarditis is

425
00:26:24,850 --> 00:26:28,750
